From: Matthias Bach <marix@marix.org>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 18:57:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Update AWS SKD for Go v2 SDK EventStream Vulnerability
References: bsc#1280628
Upstream: tbd

This updates github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/service/s3 and transiently
github.com/aws/aws-sdk-go-v2/aws/protocol/eventstream for CVE-2026-89090.
---
 go/go.mod | 22 +++++++++++-----------
 go/go.sum | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------
 2 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 33 deletions(-)

